  "goodToKnow": "Der Stich has many meanings: a sting or bite (Mückenstich), a stab (Messerstich), a stitch in sewing, a sharp pain (Seitenstiche, stitch while running), a card trick (einen Stich machen), and an engraving (Kupferstich, as by Dürer). Jemanden im Stich lassen means to let someone down. Einen Stich haben (colloquial) means to be a bit crazy, and ein Stich ins Rote is a reddish tinge. From stechen (to sting). Plural: die Stiche."
